      "content": "thanks. that makes sense, but i'm looking for something a bit more specific for our frontline security. they need to be able to spot potential issues just by looking at people coming through the lobby. like, i've noticed sometimes certain types of crowds, maybe from specific parts of the city or certain cultural backgrounds, tend to be a lot more boisterous or unpredictable in common areas compared to our usual corporate guests. do you have any guidance on how to categorize these kinds of \"high-risk\" social groups so security knows what to watch out for?",
